<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HAIL KING CHARLES | 皇家 AI 專家與開源顧問</title>
