                <a href="#about-uk" class="block px-3 py-2 text-gray-800 hover:text-royal-red font-serif">關於大不列顛</a>
                <a href="#king" class="block px-3 py-2 text-gray-800 hover:text-royal-red font-serif">現任國王</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="block px-3 py-2 text-gray-800 hover:text-royal-red font-serif">開源貢獻</a>
