                    <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-4xl text-royal-red mb-4"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-royal-dark mb-3">企業專屬知識庫 Demo</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-sm">使用 LangChain 搭建的 RAG 系統，可上傳 PDF 並進行精準問答。</p>
                    <div class="pt-2">
                        <a href="https://lin.ee/JuZFjak" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            <img src="https://scdn.line-apps.com/n/line_add_friends/btn/zh-Hant.png" alt="加入好友" height="36" border="0" class="inline-block hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
                        </a>
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500 ml-2 block mt-2">（點擊上方圖片查看 Demo）</span>
                    </div>
