                    <i class="fa-solid fa-comment-dots text-4xl text-royal-red mb-4"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-royal-dark mb-3">國王的聯繫方式</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-sm">專為國王粉絲而設，快速與查爾斯國王成為好友的 Prompt。</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 flex justify-center">
                        <img src="https://qr-official.line.me/gs/M_616htbrf_GW.png?oat_content=qr" alt="King Charles QR Code" class="w-36 h-36 object-contain border border-gray-300 p-2 shadow-lg">
                    </div>
